    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534">

                <pb facs="0621" n="547" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg547"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2078</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6230</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 31, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received June 20.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    pamphlet entitled, <hi rendition="#italic">The Bolshevik Revolution: Its Rise
                        and Meaning</hi>,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d534-f1"/> by Maxim Litvinov, <pb
                        facs="0622" n="548" xml:id="pg548"/> the plenipotentiary of the Russian
                    people’s government in Great Britain.</p>
                <p>This pamphlet has been much commented upon in this country as the best available
                    exposition of the subject, and I think that students of the question in the
                    Department will be very glad to have it. Unfortunately, I have only been able to
                    obtain one copy, and Mr. Litvinov tells me that the edition is out of print, but
                    he hopes to let me have a few more later on.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert P. Skinner</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
